Serialize vtest socket exchanges across threads.

Contexts created on different threads share one virgl_vtest_winsys and so
one socket. Unlocked request/reply pairs interleave: a reply or SCM_RIGHTS
fd reaches the wrong thread ("No headers available", "failed to get fd"),
resources and fences come back NULL, and the server drops the stream.

